Package: wclR
Type: Package
Title: Warcraft Logs Data Retrieval Helpers for R
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Vivax - Forge
Maintainer: The package maintainer <canalhorchatero@gmail.com>
Description: Layered helpers for retrieving and normalizing public
    Warcraft Logs API data in R. The package provides a cached API client,
    typed wrappers for reports, fights, actors, player details, events,
    report rankings, and zone leaderboards, joined workflow helpers for zone
    crawls, roster/event enrichment, and buff/debuff uptime analysis, plus
    compatibility helpers for older query-string based workflows.
